    /*
    |--------------------------------------------------------------------------
    | Hints — the same guidance, one hover away
    |--------------------------------------------------------------------------
    | The long halves of what used to sit permanently under a field. `helpers.*`
    | keeps the line that changes what you type; this keeps the WHY, shown through
